So my adaptive lookup is broken. Fix `find_sections` to walk containers:
```python
def walk(obj, path=()):
    if isinstance(obj, dict):
        for k,v in obj.items():
            p = path+(str(k),)
            yield p, v
            yield from walk(v, p)
    elif isinstance(obj, list):
        for i,v in enumerate(obj):
            p = path+(str(i),)
            yield p, v
            yield from walk(v, p)
```
